    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Oh Snap!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/489c39470196744fe34c6fa1a348cf74.avif?t=1726253214\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/2c5b2e8e08edbf4a6190e115477c93ff.poster.avif?t=1726253214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/2c5b2e8e08edbf4a6190e115477c93ff.webm?t=1726253214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/2c5b2e8e08edbf4a6190e115477c93ff.mp4?t=1726253214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore 10 unique and sandbox-y levels<br></li><li>Customize your crow with cute hats, scarves, and more<br></li><li>Eat delicious foods and discover new &quot;poop modes&quot;<br></li><li>Use a variety of tools and objects you pick up<br></li><li>Make new animal friends and help them out</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/7ff3bd49c4f0ca91d6ab6cd22f9cf7f9.avif?t=1726253214\" /></span><br>In this level-based, sandbox-y adventure game, you must become the coolest bird in town and earn the trust of new animal friends. Complete tasks to slowly build up your Crowputation across diverse settings, such a quaint French Riviera, Ancient Egypt, or bustling New York. Some tasks will test your skill, some will test your intellect, and some are honestly just really dumb. Pick and choose the most fun ways to create Adorable Chaos\u2122 - there's something for everyone here!<br><br>Spread your wings and soar to new heights of cuteness as you customize your adorable crow-tastic appearance!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/b306deb0d45648623cae7e72a44d47fa.avif?t=1726253214\" /></span><br>In &quot;Just Crow Things&quot;, you can live out all your crowy fantasies. Pick up all sorts of objects and make good use of them, like a leafblower to (literally) blow people a way, a graffiti can to mark your territory, or a blow torch to... uhh... warm people up at night. Yup. That's, uuh, that's totally the intended use here.<br><br>And don't forget the different poop modes, from glitter bombs to \ud83c\udf36\ufe0fspicy\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f poops... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/18bf66481cbd95c9babbdb27aa242fa2.poster.avif?t=1726253214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/18bf66481cbd95c9babbdb27aa242fa2.webm?t=1726253214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/18bf66481cbd95c9babbdb27aa242fa2.mp4?t=1726253214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/2566a9908d40c2e9a8e248f10057b363.avif?t=1726253214\" /></span><br>Ok, we might be fudging some data here... but the point stands!  The game will give you a number of optional side tasks to challenge you further - find all the hidden hats and skins, beat racing challenges across the world, and unlock a special Sandbox Mode where you can spawn all sorts of tools of mayhem.<br><br><br><strong>Anything is possible when you're a crow. Wishlist today!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/f0a36043fab31164948dee245022599d.avif?t=1726253214\" /></span>\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/2c5b2e8e08edbf4a6190e115477c93ff.poster.avif?t=1726253214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/2c5b2e8e08edbf4a6190e115477c93ff.webm?t=1726253214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/2c5b2e8e08edbf4a6190e115477c93ff.mp4?t=1726253214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore 10 unique and sandbox-y levels<br></li><li>Customize your crow with cute hats, scarves, and more<br></li><li>Eat delicious foods and discover new &quot;poop modes&quot;<br></li><li>Use a variety of tools and objects you pick up<br></li><li>Make new animal friends and help them out</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/7ff3bd49c4f0ca91d6ab6cd22f9cf7f9.avif?t=1726253214\" /></span><br>In this level-based, sandbox-y adventure game, you must become the coolest bird in town and earn the trust of new animal friends. Complete tasks to slowly build up your Crowputation across diverse settings, such a quaint French Riviera, Ancient Egypt, or bustling New York. Some tasks will test your skill, some will test your intellect, and some are honestly just really dumb. Pick and choose the most fun ways to create Adorable Chaos\u2122 - there's something for everyone here!<br><br>Spread your wings and soar to new heights of cuteness as you customize your adorable crow-tastic appearance!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/b306deb0d45648623cae7e72a44d47fa.avif?t=1726253214\" /></span><br>In &quot;Just Crow Things&quot;, you can live out all your crowy fantasies. Pick up all sorts of objects and make good use of them, like a leafblower to (literally) blow people a way, a graffiti can to mark your territory, or a blow torch to... uhh... warm people up at night. Yup. That's, uuh, that's totally the intended use here.<br><br>And don't forget the different poop modes, from glitter bombs to \ud83c\udf36\ufe0fspicy\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f poops... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/18bf66481cbd95c9babbdb27aa242fa2.poster.avif?t=1726253214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/18bf66481cbd95c9babbdb27aa242fa2.webm?t=1726253214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/18bf66481cbd95c9babbdb27aa242fa2.mp4?t=1726253214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/2566a9908d40c2e9a8e248f10057b363.avif?t=1726253214\" /></span><br>Ok, we might be fudging some data here... but the point stands!  The game will give you a number of optional side tasks to challenge you further - find all the hidden hats and skins, beat racing challenges across the world, and unlock a special Sandbox Mode where you can spawn all sorts of tools of mayhem.<br><br><br><strong>Anything is possible when you're a crow. Wishlist today!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537920/extras/f0a36043fab31164948dee245022599d.avif?t=1726253214\" /></span>\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f",
    "short_description": "You're a little crow trying to prove herself to the world. Make new animal friends, poop on unsuspecting hoomans, and steal all the shiny trinkets! Each level is a little sandbox full of fun items to discover and puzzles to solve, while leaving a bit of chaos behind. Why? Just caws!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cFinally, another chaotic animal game that has given me the same sadistic satisfaction as Untitled Goose Game\u201d<br>PCGamer<br><br>\u201c...it\u2019s the perfect game ... if you\u2019ve had a bad day and want to vent your frustration from above.\u201d<br>Destructoid<br><br>\u201cUnbound Creations is no stranger to causing a little chaos.\u201d<br>Otaku USA<br>",
